{"server":"en","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_02_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_02","title":"To be Continued","storyCode":"OF-2","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"c8ccb90a64421e43c1fdde0b3fa7e3c21b79634ae76b3fb4bc7b20270edea42a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Ceylon and the Doctor escape from Cronin's grasp, and soon meet Schwarz, who Ceylon had introduced earlier. However, it seems that she's not on the same team...","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Quick! Doctor! Let's head towards the beach!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"There are a ton of tourists gathered on the beach, so we'll be able to blend into the crowd and shrug them off!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bodyguard","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"Stand still!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"You wish!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Huh?  You're...","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Schwarz! Great! You're finally here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm so glad you're here. What's going on with Cronin?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, she's the one I was telling you about..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"Milady, Master Doykos is currently out of town. You ought to listen to Cronin."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Schwarz? What are you saying...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's head back to Cronin now and hand these people over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Schwarz","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"I do not wish to resort to violence, milady."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"...Schwarz?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["Schwarz"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["Ceylon"]}]}
